{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕拖久了会渐渐习惯眼前的样子，便先接下能做的一份。\",\n      \"key\": \"接下能做的一份\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他没把握结果如何，真做起来便有了些力气，也有点骄傲，把心力投进去时确实觉得痛快，心里仍犯嘀咕。\",\n      \"key\": \"真做起来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记从前熟悉的亲近，可如今珍惜的东西已不能像过去那样自然地拥有。\",\n      \"key\": \"熟悉的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"一察觉失落，他就急着把心思压回眼前，反复劝自己撑得住，越劝越显出他其实很在意。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复劝自己撑得住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就这样垮下去，可一想到仍放不下的事，刚撑起的劲又泄了，越发焦急，始终安顿不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"不甘心就这样\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\", \"R6\", \"R7\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\", \"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把R5落到怕自己渐渐习惯现状、先接下一份上；保留行动带来的力气和骄傲，删去R7重复的原则式总结，并用回指承接先前已有的担忧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R8\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\", \"S02-4\", \"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并分流\",\n      \"why\": \"保留投入本身带来的痛快和继续用力的冲动，不再把它写成无忧的畅快或不再审视软弱；改为快意与疑虑并存、努力稳住自己却越发显出在意，以及力气反复聚起又散掉。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\", \"S02-4\", \"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化并拆开\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的内在缺口改成对旧日亲近的惦记，再写失落如何被压回去又重新露头，分别解释旧歌般的遥远、反复自我控制和用力起落。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9d5fca4d-3404-46b5-8ef3-7dd0bc2035c3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T131829521706Z", "elapsed_seconds": 938.719, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:34:08.245422+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f09987496b5a1e949adccc016f50dccf520d57b4b487c789c1617df802f3bee1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T131829521706Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "99c15f97aaf68a3